{"schema_version":"1.9.0","id":"OESA-2026-3722","published":"2026-09-14T16:33:44Z","modified":"2026-09-13T16:45:31.526892200Z","upstream":["CVE-2026-76642"],"summary":"util-linux security update","details":"The util-linux package contains a random collection of files that implements some low-level basic linux utilities.\r\n\r\nSecurity Fix(es):\n\nutil-linux versions through 2.41.5 and 2.42.2 fail to check mount helper exit status before running post-mount hooks, allowing unprivileged users to execute privileged operations on pre-existing filesystems. Attackers can exploit X-mount.idmap or X-mount.owner hooks to clone filesystems with inherited suid bits or modify target inode permissions after a helper fails, achieving privilege escalation.(CVE-2026-76642)","affected":[{"package":{"name":"util-linux","ecosystem":"openEuler:24.03-LTS-SP1","purl":"pkg:rpm/openEuler/util-linux&distro=openEuler-24.03-LTS-SP1"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"2.39.1-41.oe2403sp1"}]}],"ecosystem_specific":{"aarch64":["libblkid-2.39.1-41.oe2403sp1.aarch64.rpm","libfdisk-2.39.1-41.oe2403sp1.aarch64.rpm","libmount-2.39.1-41.oe2403sp1.aarch64.rpm","libsmartcols-2.39.1-41.oe2403sp1.aarch64.rpm","libuuid-2.39.1-41.oe2403sp1.aarch64.rpm","python3-libmount-2.39.1-41.oe2403sp1.aarch64.rpm","util-linux-2.39.1-41.oe2403sp1.aarch64.rpm","util-linux-debuginfo-2.39.1-41.oe2403sp1.aarch64.rpm","util-linux-debugsource-2.39.1-41.oe2403sp1.aarch64.rpm","util-linux-devel-2.39.1-41.oe2403sp1.aarch64.rpm","util-linux-user-2.39.1-41.oe2403sp1.aarch64.rpm","uuidd-2.39.1-41.oe2403sp1.aarch64.rpm"],"noarch":["util-linux-help-2.39.1-41.oe2403sp1.noarch.rpm"],"src":["util-linux-2.39.1-41.oe2403sp1.src.rpm"],"x86_64":["libblkid-2.39.1-41.oe2403sp1.x86_64.rpm","libfdisk-2.39.1-41.oe2403sp1.x86_64.rpm","libmount-2.39.1-41.oe2403sp1.x86_64.rpm","libsmartcols-2.39.1-41.oe2403sp1.x86_64.rpm","libuuid-2.39.1-41.oe2403sp1.x86_64.rpm","python3-libmount-2.39.1-41.oe2403sp1.x86_64.rpm","u